go 1.26.0

// Only core is a workspace member while core is rebuilt.
//
// driver/ and examples/ pin the core they shipped against, and they import
// packages this checkout has moved or removed — so they are built the way a
// reader builds them, with GOWORK=off (CI's matrix carries the flag), instead
// of inside the workspace, where the go command would compile them against a
// core that no longer answers them. driver/'s providers move to the `inference`
// module; the examples rejoin the workspace once they are ported.
use (
	./core
)
